# MEDIAN5: order two pairs, drop the smaller low and the larger high (neither can be the
# median), then take the median of the three survivors a, b, x4.
puzzle MEDIAN5
x0 = IN 0
x1 = IN 1
x2 = IN 2
x3 = IN 3
x4 = IN 4
lo1 = MIN x0 x1
hi1 = MAX x0 x1
lo2 = MIN x2 x3
hi2 = MAX x2 x3
a = MAX lo1 lo2
b = MIN hi1 hi2
lo = MIN a b
hi = MAX a b
t = MIN hi x4
m = MAX lo t
out m
